<span id="A1.T7.2.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">System Logs: API server, Scheduler, Controller Manager, etcd logs.</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Pod Logs: Application logs, error/crash logs.</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Node Logs: Disk pressure, memory issues.</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Events: Scheduling failures, pod lifecycle events.</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Warnings and Errors: Resource issues, <span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ImagePullBackOff</span>, <span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">CrashLoopBackOff</span>.</span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T7.2.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A1.T7.2.1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Provides insights for debugging, real-time issue detection, and tracking system behavior.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
